# Keep line endings stable across platforms: the plugin is plain JS and shell
# scripts, and a CRLF/LF flip would otherwise rewrite every line of every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts stay CRLF so they open cleanly in Notepad and editors that
# still assume the DOS convention.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
